    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "沙滩上有一个装满派对必需品的大柳条篮，旁边放着靠垫和折叠椅。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/62/67/6267d1eb97a2f33fd0cba00b04ec1dd7.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/62/67/6267d1eb97a2f33fd0cba00b04ec1dd7.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p>夏季，有很多机会可以随意举行派对。所以，你要确保派对篮里装好各种所需用品。结实的桶或箱子是盛放食品的理想选择，这样你不用担心食品会在路上压碎。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
