   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "用筷子吃羊皮纸锥里的面条。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/d5/06/d506e903011e9e3252691eb373b25968.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/d5/06/d506e903011e9e3252691eb373b25968.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p>最棒的派对食品是什么？各种街边小吃！这一次，我们吃了面条和蔬菜。可以自己做，也可以在快餐车或杂货店里买。然后，用蜡纸包起来，固定成锥体的形状，以便保存、食用。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "沙滩椅旁边的塑料袋里装着饮料。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/54/ae/54aeece87e8212158cc609594cfade29.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/54/ae/54aeece87e8212158cc609594cfade29.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p>袋装饮料也是我们很喜欢的一种街边食品。调制好自己喜欢的饮品，倒入小塑料袋里（别装满，留一点空隙透气），放一根吸管，系紧就可以了。你也可以在走之前，把它们在冰箱里放一会。这样饮品会更爽口，而且还可以充当其他食品的冰袋。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "装在纸质小盛具中的甜品。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "90177589"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/84/46/8446f214c98b2003b71e05e7bf606f1f.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/84/46/8446f214c98b2003b71e05e7bf606f1f.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p>预先把甜品分好，装在硬纸盒中。这样便于运输，而且等所有人都吃完的时候，可以将纸盒展开，平放在篮子里带回家，扔到可回收垃圾桶里。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "桶里放一部智能手机，DIY一个扬声器。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "20312251"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/be/0a/be0a22c8defb8420a0871764b6fd949c.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/be/0a/be0a22c8defb8420a0871764b6fd949c.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p>没错，桶可以让里边的食品保持干净整洁。但等食品一空，桶就别有妙用了。把智能手机放在里边，播放你最喜欢的歌曲，这样你就拥有了一款非常棒的DIY扬声器。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "在沙滩上撑好伞，摆好靠垫和折叠椅，就可以举办一场放松身心的派对了。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/14/82/1482acbe2c4464402dd04703c74e30cb.jpg"
